t="115" editable="true" type="Text" border-width="0" padding="0" y="1998" bgcolor="" x="188" sizePositionLocked="false" width="300" locked="" deletable="" uniqueID="element38"><Paragraph align="center"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">BEGINNING THROWING SERIES</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph align="center"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">Five Minute Preview</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph align="center"><Segment color="#F99976" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold"/></Paragraph><Paragraph align="center"><Segment color="#F99976" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold"/></Paragraph></Element><?property ignore-whitespace="true"?><?property ignore-whitespace="false"?><Element border-color="#000000" name="Text-21" templateID="" height="430" editable="true" type="Text" border-width="0" padding="0" y="1641" bgcolor="" x="647" sizePositionLocked="false" width="500" locked="" deletable="" uniqueID="element46"><Paragraph><Segment color="#FDEDC0" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">          </Segment><Segment color="#FDEDC0" font-size="18" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold"> </Segment><Segment color="#000066" font-size="18" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">BEGINNING THROWING SERIES</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold"/></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">Watch this short five minute preview- the full video can be purchased here</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold"/></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="14" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">WEDGING</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="14" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">CENTERING</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="14" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">THROWING A WIDE BOWL</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="14" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">THROWING AN ANGULAR BOWL,  PART 1</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="14" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">THROWING AN ANGULAR BOWL,  PART 2</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="14" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">THROWING A CYLINDER</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="14" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold"/></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="14" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">This video presentation by Maryland potter Jayne Shatz will start you off on your road to success in throwing on the potter's wheel.</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="14" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold"/></Paragraph></Element><?property ignore-whitespace="true"?><Element video="http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mpLMmWjpbL8" name="YouTube Video-3" templateID="" height="344" editable="true" color="lightGrey" maintainProportion="true" type="YouTube" y="1643" x="128" sizePositionLocked="false" showBorder="false" width="425" locked="" deletable="" WOHratio="1.1971831" autoplay="false" showRelated="true" uniqueID="element50"/><?property ignore-whitespace="false"?><Element border-color="#000000" name="Text-22" templateID="" height="46" editable="true" type="Text" border-width="0" padding="0" y="2497" bgcolor="" x="158" sizePositionLocked="false" width="336" locked="" deletable="" uniqueID="element51"><Paragraph align="center"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">LARGE SCALE VESSEL MAKING </Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph align="center"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">Seven Minute Preview</Segment></Paragraph></Element><?property ignore-whitespace="true"?><Element video="http://youtu.be/W8j65oJFjXk" name="YouTube Video-4" templateID="" height="344" editable="true" color="lightGrey" maintainProportion="true" type="YouTube" y="1071" x="134" sizePositionLocked="false" width="425" locked="" deletable="" WOHratio="1.1971831" autoplay="false" showRelated="true" uniqueID="element52" showBorder="false"/><?property ignore-whitespace="false"?><Element border-color="#000000" name="Text-23" templateID="" height="533" editable="true" type="Text" border-width="0" padding="0" y="1061" bgcolor="" x="642" sizePositionLocked="false" width="479" locked="" deletable="" uniqueID="element53"><Paragraph align="center"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="18" font-family="Times New Roman">SLABS, SLABS AND MORE SLABS</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph align="center"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman">Easy Methods for Constructing Molds and Producing Ceramic Platters, Roasting Pans, and Fine Bistro Ware</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph align="left"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman"/></Paragraph><Paragraph align="left"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman">This 2 Disc video offers step by step instructions for working with slabs. For those of you that do not have a slab machine, Maryland potter, Jayne Shatz demonstrates alternative  methods for creating even, compact slabs.</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph align="left"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman"/></Paragraph><Paragraph align="left"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman">Jayne demonstrates several unique and simple techniques for creating molds from various materials. </Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph align="left"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman"/></Paragraph><Paragraph align="left"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman">Demonstrations utilizing these hump and slump molds, templates and other methods for constructing slab built pottery are covered in this  2 1/2 hour  2 Disc  video. Teacher outline included</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph align="left"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman"/></Paragraph></Element><?property ignore-whitespace="true"?><?property ignore-whitespace="false"?><Element border-color="#000000" name="Text-24" templateID="" height="44" editable="true" type="Text" border-width="0" padding="0" y="1433" bgcolor="" x="170" sizePositionLocked="false" width="366" locked="" deletable="" uniqueID="element54"><Paragraph align="center"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman">SLABS, SLABS AND MORE SLABS</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph align="center"><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman">15 Minute Preview</Segment></Paragraph></Element><?property ignore-whitespace="true"?><Element video="http://youtu.be/EjyPocE8KDQ" name="YouTube Video-5" templateID="" height="344" editable="true" color="lightGrey" maintainProportion="true" type="YouTube" y="2131" x="123" sizePositionLocked="false" width="425" locked="" deletable="" WOHratio="1.1971831" autoplay="false" showRelated="true" uniqueID="element57" showBorder="false"/><?property ignore-whitespace="false"?><Element border-color="#000000" name="Text-25" templateID="" height="81" editable="true" type="Text" border-width="0" padding="0" y="368" bgcolor="" x="756" sizePositionLocked="false" width="300" locked="" deletable="" uniqueID="element64"><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="18" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">GLAZING WITH FLAIR</Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="18" font-family="Times New Roman" font-style="bold">Methods of Glazing Pottery for the Innovative Potter</Segment></Paragraph></Element><?property ignore-whitespace="true"?><?property ignore-whitespace="false"?><Element border-color="#000000" name="Text-26" templateID="" height="572" editable="true" type="Text" border-width="0" padding="0" y="467" bgcolor="" x="672" sizePositionLocked="false" width="477" locked="" deletable="" uniqueID="element65"><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman">Tired of Glaze Chemistry workshops when all you want to do is learn HOW to glaze beautifully? </Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman"/></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#000066" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman">This 2 Disc video focuses on various techniques for glazing beautiful pottery, not the struggles of glaze chemistry. While important to understand chemistry, most potters just want to know how to glaze their ware with interesting techniques. Maryland potter, Jayne Shatz will demonstrate various methods of dripping, pouring, brush painting, latex decorating and multiple glazing for unique effects. Jayne will demonstrate with cone 6 oxidation glazes, but the techniques are applicable to all glazes. She will also demonstrate how to weigh out glazes with a digital scale and talk about glaze components. If you have wanted to learn how to glaze your pots with a sophisticated look, this video is for you. </Segment></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#F99976" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman"/></Paragraph><Paragraph><Segment color="#F99976" font-size="16" font-family="Times New Roman"/></Paragraph></Element><?property ignore-whitespace="true"?><Element video="http://youtu.be/8e6H9boxAWE" name="YouTube Video-6" templateID="" height="344" editable="true" color="lightGrey" maintainProportion="true" type="YouTube" y="439" x="150" sizePositionLocked="false" width="425" locked="" deletable="" 